  "title": "Northern Stars Turf Festival pits locals against intruders; Canterbury Park’s turf course ready for grass-heavy card",
  "summary": "Canterbury Park will host its annual Northern Stars Turf Festival on Saturday with eight races and a 5:10 p.m. central start time. Five of the races, including four one-mile $50,000 stakes, will be run over the turf course. As is typical, several horses will ship in from other states to compete for the purses including […]",
